message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "BrainFusion"
abstract: >-
  Average tissue outlines and merge spatially resolved measurements (e.g. AFM and Brillouin maps)
  of many samples onto a common template, and correlate the resulting maps.
